        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1361_4733.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unßre</unclear> fruendtlich und nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">purlich</unclear> willig
<lb n="2"/>dienst, mit erpietung aller ehren liebs
<lb n="3"/>und guots zuovor, from fuersichtig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear> und
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear>, in sonders guenstig herren, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guott</unclear> fruend und
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getruew</unclear> lieb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">puren</unclear>, es ist <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jetz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schinen</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>jars, habend ihr uns, wie üch in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear>, uß
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guotter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fruendtlicher</unclear> nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">purschaft</unclear> wegen, in
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear> noetten, nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßerm</unclear> begeren, in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allen</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">truewen</unclear> 400 fl umb den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zinß</unclear> für <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsetzt</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glichen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dß</unclear> wir zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochem</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">großem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">danck</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genommen</unclear> und empfangen. Die wil aber ein
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüwe</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">huß</unclear> hab an zuo fachen zimlich vil kosten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuott</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/>mit buwen und andern sachen, und kein gelt uß
<lb n="14"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Frundsperg</unclear></placeName>, wie man <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lang</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> hofft und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> der
<lb n="15"/>hoffnung sind, und sunst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jetz</unclear> zuo mal keins in bringen
<lb n="16"/>moegend, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">langt</unclear> der halben nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">malen</unclear> an üch, als
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruend</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getruewe</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">puren</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> fruendtlich und nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pürlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pött</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllend</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> 200 fl uf ein halbes jar, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> umb den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zinß</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verholffen</unclear> sin, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear> buw <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meister</unclear> hopt-
<lb n="21"/>man <persName resp="#ner">Hanß</persName> ald herren, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoptman</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jtel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ößlin</unclear></persName> zuo
<lb n="22"/>stellen, und hie by den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zinß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">so</unclear> von den 400 fl <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ver</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vallen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jnn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haltten</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uewerm</unclear> gfallen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heim</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gsetzt</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>sol auch in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllichm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schribung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferttget</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>werden, glich wie die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">melten</unclear> 400 fl
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1361_4734.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="26"/>Daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begerend</unclear> wir, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbietend</unclear> unß, in
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aller</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebuer</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruendtlich</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpuerlich</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söliches</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>und andern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuetragennden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vehlen</unclear>, wo es sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>begeben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuett</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschulldigen</unclear>, gantz an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gussen</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>bliben, hie by <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> und uns samptlich der
<lb n="31"/>gnaden gottes wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelchende</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Datto</unclear> den
<lb n="32"/><origDate when="1599" cert="medium" resp="#ner">27 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Januarij</unclear> anno 99 etc</origDate>.
<lb n="33"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Landtammen</unclear> und Rath der
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">usseren</unclear> Roden deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lantz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Appentzel</unclear></orgName>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1361_4735.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1361_4736.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="35"/>Den frommen fuersichtigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersamen</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> und
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear> der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="38"/>unseren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruenden</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethruewen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear>.
</p>
